{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-wooden-baby-teether-ring-sold-via-tiktok-2512-0116","content_id":"e0863044-602b-4760-9b4d-bfbc58a223af","description":"Product Safety Report for Wooden Baby Teether Ring presenting a serious risk of choking. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"27a27439-e70a-4f44-8d56-a13c010774c6","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-22T14:37:56+00:00","id":"27a27439-e70a-4f44-8d56-a13c010774c6","title":"Product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-22T15:20:49+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694957c41a2e540ccd8a5487/2512-0116-product-safety-report-baby-teething-ring.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Wooden Baby Teether Ring sold via TikTok</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as small parts may detach during reasonably foreseeable use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (TikTok).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Pacifiers/Teething Rings</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>TikTok Listing Name</td>\n      <td>Baby Soothing Teether Wooden Ring Silicone Textures Multicolor 2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>A50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Wooden teething ring with six silicone textured pieces.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_27a27439-e70a-4f44-8d56-a13c010774c6\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694957c41a2e540ccd8a5487/2512-0116-product-safety-report-baby-teething-ring.pdf\">Product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as small parts from the teether may detach during reasonably foreseeable use, creating small parts. These small parts pose a choking hazard to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths. Improvements are also required to product labelling and markings. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (TikTok).</p>\n\n<p>TikTok have contacted consumers who have purchased the product to warn them of the risks.  </p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2512-0116</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T10:06:54Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace","warning-consumers-of-risks"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T10:06:54+00:00","